WEBVTT

NOTE LUMO, The Gospel of Luke 9:18-62 (Arclight 6_GOLuke2610), en.
NOTE Timings: whisper.cpp small -dtw small per speech burst on the isolated dialogue (dialoguenhance centre channel), first word on the burst start, 2026-10-30.

1
00:03:40.450 --> 00:03:43.100
The next day, when they came down from the mountain,

2
00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:45.530
a large crowd met him.

3
00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:47.540
A man in the crowd called out,

4
00:03:47.640 --> 00:03:50.540
Teacher, I beg you to look at my son,

5
00:03:50.640 --> 00:03:52.800
for he is my only child.

6
00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:56.780
A spirit seizes him and he suddenly screams;

7
00:03:56.880 --> 00:04:00.350
it throws him into convulsions so that he foams at the mouth.

8
00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:04.150
It scarcely ever leaves him and is destroying him.

9
00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:09.160
I begged your disciples to drive it out, but they could not.

10
00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:12.750
You unbelieving and perverse generation, Jesus replied,

11
00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:17.280
how long shall I stay with you and put up with you?

12
00:04:17.380 --> 00:04:18.950
Bring your son here.

13
00:04:19.050 --> 00:04:21.550
Even while the boy was coming,

14
00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:25.100
the demon threw him to the ground in a convulsion.

15
00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:39.750
But Jesus rebuked the impure spirit.

16
00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:49.300
He healed the boy and gave him back to his father.

17
00:04:53.450 --> 00:04:56.200
And they were all amazed at the greatness of God.
